From 0be734a5e7ca79bd5cdb666a9b326a3efca501a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yin-dra <12395328+yin-dra@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 10:53:33 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] docs: match the KEY_ADD error table to the node's error
 strings

The table in writing-messages listed shortened strings that the node
never returns, so searching for them finds nothing. Quote the messages
from src/core/validations/error.rs, key_nonce_store.rs and mempool.rs,
split the custody-mismatch case into its own row, and add the expired
deadline and the one-KEY_ADD-per-minute rate limit.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 site/docs/pages/guides/writing-messages.mdx | 11 +++++++----
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/site/docs/pages/guides/writing-messages.mdx b/site/docs/pages/guides/writing-messages.mdx
index 4a79e79..e16b8f0 100644
--- a/site/docs/pages/guides/writing-messages.mdx
+++ b/site/docs/pages/guides/writing-messages.mdx
@@ -276,11 +276,14 @@ If the node rejects the message, the error is usually one of:
 
 | Error | Cause |
 | --- | --- |
-| `nonce is not greater than stored nonce` | Another `KEY_ADD` or `KEY_REMOVE` landed first. Re-read `currentUserNonce` and retry. |
+| `gasless-key nonce <n> is not greater than stored nonce <m>` | Another `KEY_ADD` or `KEY_REMOVE` landed first. Re-read `currentUserNonce` and retry. |
 | `invalid signature` | The `KeyAdd` signature did not recover the fid's custody address. Check that the custody key matches `idOf(address)`. |
-| `invalid signed key request` | The metadata is malformed, or `requestSigner` is not the custody address of `requestFid`. |
-| `invalid scope` | A scope is not an admissible message type. `KEY_ADD` / `KEY_REMOVE` are always rejected. |
-| `active key cap exceeded` | The fid already holds 1000 active gasless keys. |
+| `SignedKeyRequest metadata is malformed or signature does not verify` | The metadata does not decode, its signature does not recover `requestSigner`, or `requestFid` is not a registered fid. Metadata from `getSignedKeyRequestMetadata()` fails here (see the warning above). |
+| `requestSigner does not match custody address of requestFid` | The metadata is validly signed, but not by the current custody address of `requestFid`. |
+| `SignedKeyRequest deadline has expired` | The metadata `deadline` is earlier than the `KEY_ADD` message timestamp. Both are Farcaster time. |
+| `scope "<n>" is not a valid MessageType` | Scope `<n>` is not an admissible message type. `KEY_ADD` (16) and `KEY_REMOVE` (17) are always rejected. |
+| `active-key cap exceeded: 1000 keys per FID` | The fid already holds 1000 active gasless keys. |
+| `rate limit exceeded for FID <fid>` | Nodes accept one `KEY_ADD` per fid per minute. Wait 60 seconds before retrying. `KEY_REMOVE` is not rate limited. |
 
 ### Revoking a gasless signer
 
